WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.033
A canceled connection at Heathrow.

00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:06.742
A Gold passenger — no seat until morning, nowhere to sleep tonight.

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:08.293
Three messages in two hours.

00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:11.227
The clock on this case started before anyone read it.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.403
This is ResolveIQ.

00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:19.476
AI incident intelligence for support operations.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.303
It puts the risk of missing the deadline at eighty-one percent.

00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:25.710
Then it shows its work.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.524
Little time remaining. No alternate itinerary.

00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:30.481
A rebooking that already failed.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.387
Every recommendation is grounded in the airline's own policy.

00:00:35.437 --> 00:00:39.002
Overnight delays beyond six hours require accommodation.

00:00:39.052 --> 00:00:41.713
ResolveIQ didn't decide that. It cited it.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.538
And it's seen this before.

00:00:45.588 --> 00:00:48.771
A near-identical case, resolved the same night.

00:00:48.821 --> 00:00:52.899
Hotel, meal voucher, morning seat. Top marks, no escalation.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.286
So what reaches the specialist isn't a summary.

00:00:57.336 --> 00:00:59.714
It's a decision, with its evidence attached —

00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:02.088
and a reply to Amelia, written but not sent.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:07.150
Because nothing reaches a passenger until a person approves it.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.454
Approve it, edit it, escalate it.

00:01:09.504 --> 00:01:12.038
The AI recommends. The human decides.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.332
And every run is measured.

00:01:15.382 --> 00:01:18.362
Grounding, latency, cost — recorded, and reconstructable.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.272
ResolveIQ. Evidence in. Decision yours.
